---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SplitSection from "../components/SplitSection.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
import { offerings } from "../data/offerings";
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";

const featured = offerings.slice(0, 3);
const posts = (await getCollection("blog")).sort(
  (a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf()
);
const latestPost = posts[0];
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <SplitSection eyebrow="Welcome">
    <p slot="sidebar">
This is my little corner of the internet where I explore spirituality in the modern world.<br>
Through my writing and intuitive readings, I invite you to pause, look within, and reflect with me.<br>
My intention is to help you reconnect with your inner voice so it becomes the one you trust above all.
    </p>
	
<div class="hero-main">
  <h2>{site.tagline}</h2>
  <p>There are times in life when a different perspective can bring illumination and change everything.</p>
  <p>My intuitive readings blend tarot and playing cards to offer reflection and clarity when you're moving through a season of uncertainty. I don't believe a reading should take your power away or tell you what your future has decided for you. <i>You</i> decide your future. But in order to do that, you need an opportunity to slow down and look within.</p>
  <p>Come with a question or simply a sense that you're ready to step into something new.</p>
  <p>Together we'll explore the messages and patterns in your energy. My goal is to reflect a fresh perspective so you can move forward with greater clarity and trust in yourself.</p>
  <p>
    <div class="hero-main__cta">
    <a href="/offerings" class="btn card-cut-sm">Readings</a>
</p>
</div>

  </SplitSection>
</BaseLayout>
